DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
35419::$$$message_0264_0000_0000$$$::There's a saying that goes, "throw yourself into love."::
35420::$$$message_0264_0001_0000$$$::If you're going to engage in romance, then love so bad it makes you sick. Uncommon effort is needed to make love take root. It's romantic and melancholic. You might feel some longing while you're at it, too.::
35421::$$$message_0264_0002_0000$$$::But I, Kane Himuro, don't have much to do with that.[lr]::
35422::$$$message_0264_0002_0001$$$::As a living, breathing human, I do long for romance.[lr]::
35423::$$$message_0264_0002_0002$$$::But would I nail myself down for a sickening love? I'm afraid not.::
35424::$$$message_0264_0003_0000$$$::Still, it doesn't mean I'm uninterested.[lr]::
35425::$$$message_0264_0003_0001$$$::In fact, I have an uncommon interest in other people's love lives.[lr]::
35426::$$$message_0264_0003_0002$$$::I'll listen with a nonchalant face to conversations about who's dating or has broken up with whom, and file it in my mental ledger. Then I check it out on my own and feel satisfied.::
35427::$$$message_0264_0004_0000$$$::Only, my name will never be written in that ledger.[lr]::
35428::$$$message_0264_0004_0001$$$::Why am I so interested in love?[lr]::
35429::$$$message_0264_0004_0002$$$::I'll explain why...eventually.::
35430::$$$message_0264_0005_0000$$$::Will I one day fall in love? That's a story for the future, which I don't know. As the saying goes, "love has no masters."::
35431::$$$message_0264_0006_0000$$$::It's quiet.::
35432::$$$message_0264_0007_0000$$$::"Um, Miss Tohsaka. Would you like to join us for lunch?"::
35433::$$$message_0264_0008_0000$$$::My friend Yukika Saegusa makes an advance on our classmate Rin Tohsaka.[lr]::
35434::$$$message_0264_0008_0001$$$::She's holding lunch for two. She must have made it for just this occasion.::
35435::$$$message_0264_0009_0000$$$::"I'm sorry, Miss Saegusa. I'd like to eat with you, but I have a prior engagement today."::
35436::$$$message_0264_0010_0000$$$::"If you'll ask me again sometime, I'd be happy to join you."::
35437::$$$message_0264_0011_0000$$$::"Y-yes! Of course! [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01c(中) textoff=0]...Um, you can have this, if you want."::
35438::$$$message_0264_0012_0000$$$::She holds out a wrapped lunch box.[lr]::
35439::$$$message_0264_0012_0001$$$::Lady Tohsaka accepts it with a smile.::
35440::$$$message_0264_0013_0000$$$::"I appreciate the thought, but since you went out of your way to make it, I'll take it. I'll return the box later."::
35441::$$$message_0264_0014_0000$$$::"Okay... Um, it's not very fancy, so I don't know if you'll like it..."::
35442::$$$message_0264_0015_0000$$$::Meanwhile, my other friend Makidera is making a dubious expression.[lr]::
35443::$$$message_0264_0015_0001$$$::Is she dismayed at Yukika's repeated attempts, or dissatisfied with Lady Tohsaka's somewhat studied air?::
35444::$$$message_0264_0016_0000$$$::"No, don't worry. I'll be sure to enjoy it."::
35445::$$$message_0264_0017_0000$$$::"Thank goodness... If you tell me your tastes, I'll do my best to make a better one next time."::
35446::$$$message_0264_0018_0000$$$::"...Makino-G. Do you know Lady Tohsaka's favorite foods?"::
35447::$$$message_0264_0019_0000$$$::"I feel like she isn't picky.[lr]::
35448::$$$message_0264_0019_0001$$$::Oh, but before, we went to Tagliatelle in Shinto and she added way too much Tabasco sauce."::
35449::$$$message_0264_0020_0000$$$::"Spicy food, eh?"::
35450::$$$message_0264_0021_0000$$$::We whisper to each other.[lr]::
35451::$$$message_0264_0021_0001$$$::Nothing bad would happen if Lady Tohsaka heard us, but it's not something to talk loudly about, either.::
35452::$$$message_0264_0022_0000$$$::"I think a rich girl like her should have a sweet tooth."::
35453::$$$message_0264_0023_0000$$$::"That's not necessarily true... [l][say storage=mapex07_him_0021 name=氷室][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服01a(中) textoff=0]Ah, she's back."::
35454::$$$message_0264_0024_0000$$$::Lady Tohsaka leaves through the hall, and Yukika returns.[lr]::
35455::$$$message_0264_0024_0001$$$::Two steps forward, one step backward...I suppose. Still, her expression is gentle and pleasant.::
35456::$$$message_0264_0025_0000$$$::"So close, Yukicchi. You could've given her another push. If you said 'I made this for you, so eat it!' even Tohsaka would have dropped her other engagement."::
35457::$$$message_0264_0026_0000$$$::"But I don't want to bother her."::
35458::$$$message_0264_0027_0000$$$::"No, Yukika. You can get away with acting slightly more rambunctious."::
35459::$$$message_0264_0028_0000$$$::"Anyway, this is Lady Tohsaka we're talking about. It's not a challenge that can be overcome in a day or a night. We'll try again after she returns the lunch box."::
35460::$$$message_0264_0029_0000$$$::Slightly dejected, Yukika laughs.::
35461::$$$message_0264_0030_0000$$$::Yukika has a kind heart. She makes you want to watch over her forever.::
35462::$$$message_0264_0031_0000$$$::"What's this, chief strategist? You going for a battle of attrition?"::
35463::$$$message_0264_0032_0000$$$::"I am not your strategist, and you are not our commander, Maki.[lr]::
35464::$$$message_0264_0032_0001$$$::Well, now the three of us can have lunch."::
35465::$$$message_0264_0033_0000$$$::On the other hand, this is how Makidera is.[lr]::
35466::$$$message_0264_0033_0001$$$::Normally, this kind of thing would get on my nerves, but we've been friends for three years, so she's now in the realm of familiarity.::
35467::$$$message_0264_0034_0000$$$::In fact, it's incredibly bizarre to see her wearing a furisode in her old-fashioned house, acting all prim and proper. It does look good on her, yes. However, I still think that this is how Makidera should act.::
35468::$$$message_0264_0035_0000$$$::"Tch, if Tohsaka didn't take the lunch box, I could've had some of it."::
35469::$$$message_0264_0036_0000$$$::"Did you eat your lunch early because you were expecting that?"::
35470::$$$message_0264_0037_0000$$$::Makidera's lunch box is only half full.[lr]::
35471::$$$message_0264_0037_0001$$$::This decrease can only be attributed to her habit of eating before lunchtime.::
35472::$$$message_0264_0038_0000$$$::...I know she's a track runner, but isn't this somewhat of a problem for a high school girl?::
35473::$$$message_0264_0039_0000$$$::"Oh, I can give you a little bit of mine, Maki."::
35474::$$$message_0264_0040_0000$$$::"Ooh, thanks. Ah, much obliged. Sorry as usual, Yukicchi. I'll make it up to you at Edomaeya later."::
35475::$$$message_0264_0041_0000$$$::Thus passes our long, quiet lunch break.[lr]::
35476::$$$message_0264_0041_0001$$$::I take a mouthful of my sandwich containing lettuce, tomato, and well-seasoned mustard.::
35477::$$$message_0264_0042_0000$$$::Makidera munches on her lunch, supplemented by Yukika's food.::
35478::$$$message_0264_0043_0000$$$::"But y'know, I guess Tohsaka's not getting along so well, either."::
35479::$$$message_0264_0044_0000$$$::She speaks a casual sentence.[lr]::
35480::$$$message_0264_0044_0001$$$::Yukika and I look up.::
35481::$$$message_0264_0045_0000$$$::"Really, Maki?"::
35482::$$$message_0264_0046_0000$$$::"Ugh...uh, well. We used to go shopping every now and then, but lately she's been so busy, I've been getting the Yukicchi treatment too."::
35483::$$$message_0264_0047_0000$$$::"Oh... I see. So Miss Tohsaka wasn't avoiding me."::
35484::$$$message_0264_0048_0000$$$::Yukika nods in relief.[lr]::
35485::$$$message_0264_0048_0001$$$::I would like to ask who would be so ill-mannered as to actively avoid our good Yukika.::
35486::$$$message_0264_0049_0000$$$::"Um... Could Miss Tohsaka be..."::
35487::$$$message_0264_0050_0000$$$::Yukika turns to me and Makidera.[lr]::
35488::$$$message_0264_0050_0001$$$::Now the center of attention, she whispers in a small voice.::
35489::$$$message_0264_0051_0000$$$::"Could she be...um, I'm just speaking hypothetically. Could she be dating someone?"::
35490::$$$message_0264_0052_0000$$$::"...Ah, you didn't know, Yukika?[lr]::
35491::$$$message_0264_0052_0001$$$::Lady Tohsaka's dating Shirou Emiya from 3-C."::
35492::$$$message_0264_0053_0000$$$::I thought this was already well-known, but maybe it was just me.[lr]::
35493::$$$message_0264_0053_0001$$$::Of course, Makidera's aware. There's no way she wouldn't be.::
35494::$$$message_0264_0054_0000$$$::"Huh... That Emiya?"::
35495::$$$message_0264_0055_0000$$$::"Yeah, [large]that[rf] Shirou Emiya. I can't believe it!"::
35496::$$$message_0264_0056_0000$$$::"This is [font italic=true]Emiya[font italic=false] we're talking about. The student council president's add-on equipment. The Emiya who's also known as the fake school janitor, the cultural clubs' handyman, the kyudo club's vacuum cleaner, and the brownie of Homurahara!"::
35497::$$$message_0264_0057_0000$$$::"You know a lot of awful nicknames for him, Makino-G.[cacheimage storage=氷室制服02a(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02a(近) textoff=0] By the way, Yukika, a brownie is a type of Irish fairy..."::
35498::$$$message_0264_0058_0000$$$::"No one asked you to explain that!"::
35499::$$$message_0264_0059_0000$$$::She cuts me off, but not everyone knows what a brownie is...::
35500::$$$message_0264_0060_0000$$$::"Oh, a fairy. I thought by brownie, you meant he was a chocolate cake or something."::
35501::$$$message_0264_0061_0000$$$::"...It's a fairy that lives in people's homes and does chores when the residents aren't home."::
35502::$$$message_0264_0062_0000$$$::"It does embody Emiya quite well. But coming from Makino-G, you might think she's talking about the cake."::
35503::$$$message_0264_0063_0000$$$::"So yeah, Emiya is dating Tohsaka! She's got bad taste. There are so many other boys she could've picked from. He doesn't fit her iron image!"::
35504::$$$message_0264_0064_0000$$$::Makidera's criticisms become increasingly unhinged.[lr]::
35505::$$$message_0264_0064_0001$$$::...She's been incensed since their relationship became obvious in April.[lr]::
35506::$$$message_0264_0064_0002$$$::Makidera insists that it's because her own reputation, as one of the few friends of the untouchable school idol Rin Tohsaka, is devalued by her choice of partner.::
35507::$$$message_0264_0065_0000$$$::"Anyway, calm down. This isn't something you can fix with Shaolin Temple kung fu."::
35508::$$$message_0264_0066_0000$$$::"No, I'm reaching the end of my patience. How can you be this calm, Himuro!?"::
35509::$$$message_0264_0067_0000$$$::"They're already public with it, and they don't really do anything to stand out."::
35510::$$$message_0264_0068_0000$$$::"Oh, I see... Miss Tohsaka and Emiya...[lr]::
35511::$$$message_0264_0068_0001$$$::Are they good together?"::
35512::$$$message_0264_0069_0000$$$::...I would say they're about as similar as chalk and cheese.[lr]::
35513::$$$message_0264_0069_0001$$$::Though I wouldn't say they're a terrible match for each other, it's hard not to make such comparisons between them.::
35514::$$$message_0264_0070_0000$$$::Makidera's causing a commotion, but she'll get tired and calm down eventually.[lr]::
35515::$$$message_0264_0070_0001$$$::Meanwhile, Yukika and I continue eating our lunch. People around us are watching Makidera's eccentric behavior, remarking "not again."::
35516::$$$message_0264_0071_0000$$$::    Makidera runs out of energy and slumps down.::
35517::$$$message_0264_0072_0000$$$::"Haah. What a waste.[lr]::
35518::$$$message_0264_0072_0001$$$::I wish she had better taste. Mitsuzuri's been weird too, ever since then."::
35519::$$$message_0264_0073_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri? Ayako Mitsuzuri, the former kyudo club captain?[lr]::
35520::$$$message_0264_0073_0001$$$::   I'm curious what Makino-G means by "weird."::
35521::$$$message_0264_0074_0000$$$::"Miss Mitsuzuri?'::
35522::$$$message_0264_0075_0000$$$::"Ahh, you might not have heard... What about you, Himuro?"::
35523::$$$message_0264_0076_0000$$$::"I haven't heard anything either.[lr]::
35524::$$$message_0264_0076_0001$$$::There were rumors for a while, but they proved groundless. Ayako Mitsuzuri is an honor student on Tohsaka's level, so she'd never engage in any misconduct."::
35525::$$$message_0264_0077_0000$$$::It was said that around February, Ayako Mitsuzuri was taken into protective custody and hospitalized.[lr]::
35526::$$$message_0264_0077_0001$$$::Some people spread malicious rumors that she was hanging in the wrong places or dabbling in illicit drugs, but afterward...::
35527::$$$message_0264_0078_0000$$$::"Yeah... There was a big accident and the school was in bad shape."::
35528::$$$message_0264_0079_0000$$$::Yukika mutters uncomfortably.[lr]::
35529::$$$message_0264_0079_0001$$$::Around the same time, there was a chemical accident at Homurahara, resulting in comas and the hospitalization of a number of students. The major incident immediately drowned out any rumors about Ayako Mitsuzuri.[lr]::
35530::$$$message_0264_0079_0002$$$::...There were some inconsistencies with the details of the accident, not to mention it was just bizarre, but we'll leave it at that for now.::
35531::$$$message_0264_0080_0000$$$::"Agh... That was a rough time, in a lot of ways.[lr]::
35532::$$$message_0264_0080_0001$$$::We had to pause club activities and visit the people in the hospital."::
35533::$$$message_0264_0081_0000$$$::I seem to have brought up unpleasant memories.[lr]::
35534::$$$message_0264_0081_0001$$$::I brush the crumbs from my hands and bow to my friends.::
35535::$$$message_0264_0082_0000$$$::"Sorry. I brought up an inappropriate subject for a meal."::
35536::$$$message_0264_0083_0000$$$::"Nah, you didn't do anything wrong. Mitsuzuri, though..."::
35537::$$$message_0264_0084_0000$$$::Makidera quickly regains her composure and resumes wolfing down her lunch.::
35538::$$$message_0264_0085_0000$$$::"It's just weird. I think she's gotta be dating someone. Yeah. It's just my intuition, though."::
35539::$$$message_0264_0086_0000$$$::   Twitch.[lr]::
35540::$$$message_0264_0086_0001$$$::My eyebrow moves involuntarily.[lr]::
35541::$$$message_0264_0086_0002$$$::Outwardly, I remain calm. But inwardly, my curiosity is piqued.[lr]::
35542::$$$message_0264_0086_0003$$$::Ayako Mitsuzuri is dating someone.[lr]::
35543::$$$message_0264_0086_0004$$$::I can't dismiss that. After all...::
35544::$$$message_0264_0087_0000$$$::"Yeah... We're all third-years, so maybe people are thinking about dating."::
35545::$$$message_0264_0088_0000$$$::"I don't think it's because of the year anyone's in.[lr]::
35546::$$$message_0264_0088_0001$$$::Ahh, Himuro. Do you know anything about Mitsuzuri?"::
35547::$$$message_0264_0089_0000$$$::"...No. It's news to me."::
35548::$$$message_0264_0090_0000$$$::At any rate, there's nothing about Ayako Mitsuzuri's male relationships in my information network.::
35549::$$$message_0264_0091_0000$$$::It's gone completely under my radar.[lr]::
35550::$$$message_0264_0091_0001$$$::I feel irritated that Makidera somehow found out before I did.::
35551::$$$message_0264_0092_0000$$$::...But I keep smiling.::
35552::$$$message_0264_0093_0000$$$::"Lady Mitsuzuri, huh... Is this recent news?"::
35553::$$$message_0264_0094_0000$$$::"No, it's a while ago. Around April, I think... Back then, she was definitely acting weird. Do you remember?"::
35554::$$$message_0264_0095_0000$$$::It's unreasonable to ask me to remember something from so long ago when I wasn't paying attention to her.[lr]::
35555::$$$message_0264_0095_0001$$$::Makidera's animal instincts might have prompted her to check in from time to time.::
35556::$$$message_0264_0096_0000$$$::No...my observational skills could still use work.::
35557::$$$message_0264_0097_0000$$$::"Yeah, she seemed kinda panicky."::
35558::$$$message_0264_0098_0000$$$::"Oh, one seat cushion to Yukicchi. Great job. She's taken the lead, what are you going to do now, Himuro!?"::
35559::$$$message_0264_0099_0000$$$::"I can't do anything now. So, do you know who she's seeing?"::
35560::$$$message_0264_0100_0000$$$::I'm curious, of course.[lr]::
35561::$$$message_0264_0100_0001$$$::However, Makidera disappoints me with a slack-jawed stare.::
35562::$$$message_0264_0101_0000$$$::"...Huh?"::
35563::$$$message_0264_0102_0000$$$::"That's not an answer. You said that Ayako Mitsuzuri started dating someone, so the logical thing to do would be to find out who. Are you such a ragamuffin that you didn't even try?"::
35564::$$$message_0264_0103_0000$$$::"Ragamuffin... That makes me sound like a dirty muffin, or something."::
35565::$$$message_0264_0104_0000$$$::Perhaps I should have said "thoughtless." It certainly describes Makidera.[lr]::
35566::$$$message_0264_0104_0001$$$::No, I shouldn't be trying to create a character sketch of Kaede Makidera using descriptors such as "ragamuffin," "thoughtless," or "animal instincts" right now. What I need to do now is...::
35567::$$$message_0264_0105_0000$$$::"I'm not sure what you expect from me. Mitsuzuri doesn't cut corners. Her guard's as tough as yours or Tohsaka's."::
35568::$$$message_0264_0106_0000$$$::"So you regard Lady Tohsaka and I equally. But..."::
35569::$$$message_0264_0107_0000$$$::   Then who is Ayako Mitsuzuri's significant other?::
35570::$$$message_0264_0108_0000$$$::I want to know. It's starting to gnaw at me so badly I can't sit still. But I'm not the sort of person to act rashly on an impulse.::
35571::$$$message_0264_0109_0000$$$::"Hmm, Miss Mitsuzuri's boyfriend..."::
35572::$$$message_0264_0110_0000$$$::"You look pretty curious, Himuro."::
35573::$$$message_0264_0111_0000$$$::"..."::
35574::$$$message_0264_0112_0000$$$::This damned black panther and her instincts.[lr]::
35575::$$$message_0264_0112_0001$$$::I close my lunch box and reluctantly nod.::
35576::$$$message_0264_0113_0000$$$::"...Yes, I'm curious."::
35577::$$$message_0264_0114_0000$$$::"Yeah? Then why don't we find out who her boyfriend is?"::
35578::$$$message_0264_0115_0000$$$::The black panther bares her fangs and smiles. All right, that's an overstatement.[lr]::
35579::$$$message_0264_0115_0001$$$::But there is something reassuring about her daring smile.[lr]::
35580::$$$message_0264_0115_0002$$$::If our interests align, her agility and my insight should mesh well. That leaves...::
35581::$$$message_0264_0116_0000$$$::"Uh, um, Maki, we shouldn't!"::
35582::$$$message_0264_0117_0000$$$::"Why not, Yukicchi? Ayako Mitsuzuri is an honor student and the pride of Homurahara! Her boyfriend can't be a secret!"::
35583::$$$message_0264_0118_0000$$$::"We have a right to know under the Constitution of Japan!"::
35584::$$$message_0264_0119_0000$$$::"The constitution doesn't list any such right. It's also a breach of her privacy."::
35585::$$$message_0264_0120_0000$$$::"If you want us to leave it alone, Yukika, then we will."::
35586::$$$message_0264_0121_0000$$$::If we're joined by Yukika's decency and common sense, then no half-hearted interference can stop us.::
35587::$$$message_0264_0122_0000$$$::For a moment, Yukika looks back and forth, like a prairie dog that can't find its burrow...[wm canskip=0]::
35588::$$$message_0264_0123_0000$$$::"...Um, I do want to see who Miss Mitsuzuri's boyfriend is..."::
35589::$$$message_0264_0124_0000$$$::"Then that settles it."::
35590::$$$message_0264_0125_0000$$$::"Wahaha! You better watch out, Ayako Mitsuzuri, we're going to lay your secrets for all the world to know! Heaven's net has large meshes, but nothing escapes!"::
35591::$$$message_0264_0126_0000$$$::"How unusual, Makino-G. You actually used an idiom correctly for once."::
35592::$$$message_0264_0127_0000$$$::"Shut up!"::
35593::$$$message_0264_0128_0000$$$::And then, the period bell rings.[lr]::
35594::$$$message_0264_0128_0001$$$::For now, I should be content that we at least have agreed on something.::
35595::$$$message_0264_0129_0000$$$::"Dang it, we talked so much that I forgot to finish eating."::
35596::$$$message_0264_0130_0000$$$::"You never fail to disappoint."::
35597::$$$message_0264_0131_0000$$$::"[fg index=1000 time=300 pos=l storage=蒔寺制服01c(近) textoff=0]So, [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03a(近),i教室][wvl canskip=false time=500][rep storages=蒔寺制服03a(近) time=300 poss=lc bg=i教室 indexes=1000 textoff=0]yeah. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02c(近),i教室][wvl canskip=false time=500][rep storages=蒔寺制服02c(近) time=300 poss=c bg=i教室 indexes=1000 textoff=0]About what we said at lunch..."::
35598::$$$message_0264_0132_0000$$$::We reunite after sixth period.[lr]::
35599::$$$message_0264_0132_0001$$$::The school is noisy as the people around us are either heading home, or going to their clubs or after-school study programs. We use the commotion to mask our conversation.::
35600::$$$message_0264_0133_0000$$$::"Lady Mitsuzuri?"::
35601::$$$message_0264_0134_0000$$$::"Yeah. Who do you think her boyfriend is?"::
35602::$$$message_0264_0135_0000$$$::This topic should indeed be kept on the down-low.[lr]::
35603::$$$message_0264_0135_0001$$$::I suggest that we talk while we walk to the track & field club. Makidera and Yukika nod in agreement.::
35604::$$$message_0264_0136_0000$$$::"...Yukicchi, you noticed first. Any ideas?"::
35605::$$$message_0264_0137_0000$$$::Makidera checks with Yukika first.[lr]::
35606::$$$message_0264_0137_0001$$$::She thinks about it for a moment,[l][lr]::
35607::$$$message_0264_0137_0002$$$::and then shakes her head. I figured.::
35608::$$$message_0264_0138_0000$$$::"No, I can't really imagine anyone who she would go out with."::
35609::$$$message_0264_0139_0000$$$::"Right? In which case, we need your ice-cold brain cells, Himuro."::
35610::$$$message_0264_0140_0000$$$::...If you don't know, then just say so.[lr]::
35611::$$$message_0264_0140_0001$$$::Also, I think she means that I have a sharp mind, but it could also sound like my brain is asleep.::
35612::$$$message_0264_0141_0000$$$::"...It's hard to say. Our only option is to assign probabilities to her known acquaintances."::
35613::$$$message_0264_0142_0000$$$::"Known acquaintances? Probabilities? Kane, can't you use smaller words?"::
35614::$$$message_0264_0143_0000$$$::"You mean we should try to guess who it is from the people that Miss Mitsuzuri knows, right, Kane?"::
35615::$$$message_0264_0144_0000$$$::I'm glad Yukika is quick on the uptake.::
35616::$$$message_0264_0145_0000$$$::"I getcha, I getcha. Then who?"[lr]::
35617::$$$message_0264_0145_0001$$$::"Let me think... Hm."::
35618::$$$message_0264_0146_0000$$$::Who among Ayako Mitsuzuri's male acquaintances would be a potential romantic partner...?[lr]::
35619::$$$message_0264_0146_0001$$$::I can rule out her underclassmen. Since it started in April, I can exclude alumni for the time being, as well.[lr]::
35620::$$$message_0264_0146_0002$$$::That leaves...[lr]::
35621::$$$message_0264_0146_0003$$$::One person who's likely to have love affairs.::
35622::$$$message_0264_0147_0000$$$::The playboy of Homurahara's third years, who pops up in my ledger from time to time.::
35623::$$$message_0264_0148_0000$$$::"...Matou."::
35624::$$$message_0264_0149_0000$$$::"No way."::
35625::$$$message_0264_0150_0000$$$::Makidera's immediate reaction is disbelief.[lr]::
35626::$$$message_0264_0150_0001$$$::Yukika looks surprised too, but she doesn't answer. I didn't think it was that odd of an idea, though.::
35627::$$$message_0264_0151_0000$$$::"Why are you surprised?"::
35628::$$$message_0264_0152_0000$$$::"Well, it's Shinji, not his second-year sister Sakura."::
35629::$$$message_0264_0153_0000$$$::"Ooh... Matou, huh..."::
35630::$$$message_0264_0154_0000$$$::Yukika makes a distinctly uncomfortable face, which I find quite striking.[lr]::
35631::$$$message_0264_0154_0001$$$::I can be sure after seeing her reaction. Shinji Matou was quite infamous.::
35632::$$$message_0264_0155_0000$$$::"I really don't think it's him, Himuro."::
35633::$$$message_0264_0156_0000$$$::"Lady Mitsuzuri was the kyudo club captain, and Shinji Matou was the vice-captain. They have been associated for a long time."::
35634::$$$message_0264_0157_0000$$$::"And while Matou's behavior as a second-year was intolerable, I hear he's rather well-behaved these days."::
35635::$$$message_0264_0158_0000$$$::I've only heard that, mind you. I haven't seen it for myself yet.[lr]::
35636::$$$message_0264_0158_0001$$$::It's hard to forget the past humiliation of him saying, "ahaha, Himuro, your dad's a big shot in the city, so you don't get to hang out with us."::
35637::$$$message_0264_0159_0000$$$::"That's enough to make you say Mitsuzuri and Shinji!? People said they butted heads all the time in the club."::
35638::$$$message_0264_0160_0000$$$::"But February is what we need to pay attention to. Matou would have been hospitalized in the same facility as Lady Mitsuzuri."::
35639::$$$message_0264_0161_0000$$$::"It was a long time before they were both discharged, so we can't deny the possibility they might have had some contact in the hospital."::
35640::$$$message_0264_0162_0000$$$::I know it's a stretch, but I decide to advance the hypothesis.::
35641::$$$message_0264_0163_0000$$$::"I'm not saying that they shared mutual pity as invalids, but they might have bonded over the common experience, and their existing relationship could have developed into romance... It isn't inconceivable."::
35642::$$$message_0264_0164_0000$$$::"And Lady Mitsuzuri might have helped Shinji Matou change his ways. Don't you find that persuasive at all?"::
35643::$$$message_0264_0165_0000$$$::I'm sure that Shinji Matou would have restrained his behavior around Ayako Mitsuzuri.::
35644::$$$message_0264_0166_0000$$$::Shinji Matou was disliked for his irresponsible recklessness, but if he's tempered his behavior since, it stands to reason that there was someone to be a guiding hand.::
35645::$$$message_0264_0167_0000$$$::"Ohh, I get it. It doesn't sound impossible when you put it that way."::
35646::$$$message_0264_0168_0000$$$::"Hmm... Miss Mitsuzuri and Matou... Hmmmm..."[wm canskip=0]::
35647::$$$message_0264_0169_0000$$$::Yukika still looks skeptical, but it's only to be expected.[lr]::
35648::$$$message_0264_0169_0001$$$::Makidera frowns after accepting my logic.::
35649::$$$message_0264_0170_0000$$$::"But I thought Shinji Matou was only after Tohsaka."::
35650::$$$message_0264_0171_0000$$$::"What are you talking about? You know Lady Tohsaka. She would never settle for Shinji Matou."::
35651::$$$message_0264_0172_0000$$$::"Perhaps he had a change of heart after finding out she started dating Emiya."::
35652::$$$message_0264_0173_0000$$$::"..."::
35653::$$$message_0264_0174_0000$$$::...Is Makidera having some facial nerve pain?[lr]::
35654::$$$message_0264_0174_0001$$$::I can see her cheeks twitching whenever Emiya and Tohsaka's names come up.[lr]::
35655::$$$message_0264_0174_0002$$$::She wants Lady Tohsaka to remain solitary, so she must see Emiya as a nemesis.::
35656::$$$message_0264_0175_0000$$$::...Ayako Mitsuzuri and Shinji Matou, eh?[lr]::
35657::$$$message_0264_0175_0001$$$::These two are quite...::
35658::$$$message_0264_0176_0000$$$::"...They're not very picturesque, this couple."::
35659::$$$message_0264_0177_0000$$$::"There it is, Himuro's eye for beauty. You always make such a fuss about that."::
35660::$$$message_0264_0178_0000$$$::"But I think that's important, too..."::
35661::$$$message_0264_0179_0000$$$::I'm glad Yukika understands, at least.[lr]::
35662::$$$message_0264_0179_0001$$$::I clear my throat and continue.::
35663::$$$message_0264_0180_0000$$$::"...Now, this is the Mitsuzuri-Matou couple hypothesis.[lr]::
35664::$$$message_0264_0180_0001$$$::The question is, how do we turn this possibility into proof?"::
35665::$$$message_0264_0181_0000$$$::"...Should we catch Mitsuzuri and ask her?"::
35666::$$$message_0264_0182_0000$$$::"Do you want to try it yourself, Makino-G?"::
35667::$$$message_0264_0183_0000$$$::I give her off-the-cuff suggestion a cold answer.::
35668::$$$message_0264_0184_0000$$$::Makidera reacts with an exaggerated "ugh," though not angrily.::
35669::$$$message_0264_0185_0000$$$::"I was kidding. If I ask that martial scholar Mitsuzuri a question like that, she'll just beat me up.[lr]::
35670::$$$message_0264_0185_0001$$$::I know. Why don't you try asking, Yukicchi?"::
35671::$$$message_0264_0186_0000$$$::"Eh? Huh? M-me?"::
35672::$$$message_0264_0187_0000$$$::Yukika would be a better choice than Makidera.[lr]::
35673::$$$message_0264_0187_0001$$$::But it's hard to ask her to do that so suddenly.::
35674::$$$message_0264_0188_0000$$$::"We don't necessarily have to ask the person in question. All we want is supporting or concrete evidence."::
35675::$$$message_0264_0189_0000$$$::"There are times in romance when relevant parties are the least trustworthy."::
35676::$$$message_0264_0190_0000$$$::"There's the great Himuro's heartless logic. Then if Mitsuzuri's out, and Shinji's out...[wvl][playstop time=3000 nowait=true] Oh, I know someone good."::
35677::$$$message_0264_0191_0000$$$::   Makidera looks proud of herself.::
35678::$$$message_0264_0192_0000$$$::Yukika and I pause to hear her suggestion.[lr]::
35679::$$$message_0264_0192_0001$$$::Makidera looks left and right, then confidently speaks a name.::
35680::$$$message_0264_0193_0000$$$::"Minori Mitsuzuri."::
35681::$$$message_0264_0194_0000$$$::"Her little brother, the first year?"::
35682::$$$message_0264_0195_0000$$$::"Well, what an interesting choice. I see, he's a current club member, and Lady Mitsuzuri's actual brother."::
35683::$$$message_0264_0196_0000$$$::As Ayako Mitsuzuri's close relative, his testimony would be invaluable.[lr]::
35684::$$$message_0264_0196_0001$$$::He might even be able to immediately identify her partner for us. They live under the same roof, after all. His position is different from that of a regular schoolmate.[lr]::
35685::$$$message_0264_0196_0002$$$::"Right?" [chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服02d(中) textoff=0]Makidera says smugly.[lr]::
35686::$$$message_0264_0196_0003$$$::But Yukika hesitates...and eventually shakes her head sadly.::
35687::$$$message_0264_0197_0000$$$::"...I don't think that'll work."::
35688::$$$message_0264_0198_0000$$$::"Huh? Why not, Yukicchi?"::
35689::$$$message_0264_0199_0000$$$::Makidera is flustered by the unexpected skepticism.[lr]::
35690::$$$message_0264_0199_0001$$$::I also didn't think Yukika would shoot this suggestion down.::
35691::$$$message_0264_0200_0000$$$::"Yukika, why do you say that?"::
35692::$$$message_0264_0201_0000$$$::"Um... You know, little brothers don't necessarily know things like who their big sister is dating. My little brothers don't pay any attention to me at all."::
35693::$$$message_0264_0202_0000$$$::"Oh...right. Yeah, I can see that."::
35694::$$$message_0264_0203_0000$$$::Makidera pouts, as if her sore spot was hit.[lr]::
35695::$$$message_0264_0203_0001$$$::Yukika does have four younger brothers. I should value her insight.::
35696::$$$message_0264_0204_0000$$$::"Now that you mention it... I heard her little brother has a pretty bad attitude."::
35697::$$$message_0264_0205_0000$$$::"While they are siblings, involving her brother could actually make this more difficult... Hm, that's troubling."::
35698::$$$message_0264_0206_0000$$$::I stop.[lr]::
35699::$$$message_0264_0206_0001$$$::Unfortunately, the investigation has suddenly ground to a halt. Is there anyone else who's closer to Shinji Matou than Ayako Mitsuzuri...?::
35700::$$$message_0264_0207_0000$$$::   Of course there is. The perfect witness, in fact.::
35701::$$$message_0264_0208_0000$$$::"There is someone... I bet she knows."::
35702::$$$message_0264_0209_0000$$$::"What did you want to talk about, Makidera-senpai?"::
35703::$$$message_0264_0210_0000$$$::Sakura Matou is Shinji Matou's younger sister.::
35704::$$$message_0264_0211_0000$$$::It's simple. If we can't ask Ayako Mitsuzuri's younger brother, than we can just ask Shinji Matou's younger sister.[lr]::
35705::$$$message_0264_0211_0001$$$::Of course, siblings might not be interested in each other's love lives, but surely she has some passing interest in her brother's activities.::
35706::$$$message_0264_0212_0000$$$::"Ah... Sorry, it's not a big deal, actually."::
35707::$$$message_0264_0213_0000$$$::"Is it a club matter?"::
35708::$$$message_0264_0214_0000$$$::She's the current kyudo club captain. Her predecessor was Ayako Mitsuzuri herself.[lr]::
35709::$$$message_0264_0214_0001$$$::She's in the ideal position to be a witness.::
35710::$$$message_0264_0215_0000$$$::The beautiful, mild-mannered girl, Lady Matou, looks somewhat uncomfortable.[lr]::
35711::$$$message_0264_0215_0001$$$::...It's only natural she would. We're all third-years, while she's a second-year. We also summoned her to the thicket behind the school, so I'm sure she's unsettled.::
35712::$$$message_0264_0216_0000$$$::"...We're sorry for asking you to meet us here. I wanted to take a moment to ask you a few questions, Miss Matou."::
35713::$$$message_0264_0217_0000$$$::"Okay..."::
35714::$$$message_0264_0218_0000$$$::"...If it's uncomfortable to talk about, you don't have to tell us anything."::
35715::$$$message_0264_0219_0000$$$::That said, I can see the question marks piling up over Sakura Matou's head.::
35716::$$$message_0264_0220_0000$$$::Makidera's lips are sealed for now, and Yukika looks unsettled.[lr]::
35717::$$$message_0264_0220_0001$$$::I adjust my glasses with a finger, and take a deep breath...::
35718::$$$message_0264_0221_0000$$$::"I want to ask you a question about your older brother, Shinji Matou."::
35719::$$$message_0264_0222_0000$$$::   For an instant...[lr]::
35720::$$$message_0264_0222_0001$$$::The ambient sound of the woods ceases.[lr]::
35721::$$$message_0264_0222_0002$$$::That's how dramatic a change the name "Shinji Matou" induced in her.::
35722::$$$message_0264_0223_0000$$$::"..."::
35723::$$$message_0264_0224_0000$$$::She stirs, hesitating slightly.[lr]::
35724::$$$message_0264_0224_0001$$$::She, I, and even Yukika forget to breathe.::
35725::$$$message_0264_0225_0000$$$::"...What about my brother?"::
35726::$$$message_0264_0226_0000$$$::Her demeanor suddenly changes. I sense clear trepidation and doubt from her.[lr]::
35727::$$$message_0264_0226_0001$$$::I can tell that Makidera has already started slowly backing away. Yukika is just stunned at the sudden change in Lady Matou.[lr]::
35728::$$$message_0264_0226_0002$$$::Uncharacteristically of me, I quickly try to fill the silence.::
35729::$$$message_0264_0227_0000$$$::"It's trivial. Just common gossip, really."::
35730::$$$message_0264_0228_0000$$$::"So I'd appreciate if you could be a little less on guard..."::
35731::$$$message_0264_0229_0000$$$::Lady Matou doesn't show any sign of lowering her guard.::
35732::$$$message_0264_0230_0000$$$::Did we fail? I had no idea mentioning Shinji Matou would induce such distrust in her.::
35733::$$$message_0264_0231_0000$$$::What's going on between these two siblings? Something I want to learn lies before me...or so I think.::
35734::$$$message_0264_0232_0000$$$::Makidera is tugging on my sleeve, looking uneasy.::
35735::$$$message_0264_0233_0000$$$::"...Should we quit, Himuro?"::
35736::$$$message_0264_0234_0000$$$::"Not after coming this far. While we could stop, I wouldn't feel comfortable leaving things as they are after raising Lady Matou's suspicions. While we might be fine with it, it would hurt Yukika."::
35737::$$$message_0264_0235_0000$$$::"..."::
35738::$$$message_0264_0236_0000$$$::This conversation is getting uncomfortable.::
35739::$$$message_0264_0237_0000$$$::I slightly shake my head, and ask my question with a stern expression.::
35740::$$$message_0264_0238_0000$$$::"Is your brother, Shinji Matou..."::
35741::$$$message_0264_0239_0000$$$::"..."::
35742::$$$message_0264_0240_0000$$$::"...in a romantic relationship with Ayako Mitsuzuri?"::
35743::$$$message_0264_0241_0000$$$::Sakura Matou's[lr]::
35744::$$$message_0264_0241_0001$$$::   eyes go wide, and she's struck literally speechless.::
35745::$$$message_0264_0242_0000$$$::"[chgfg time=200 storage=桜制服08l(中) textoff=0][wait canskip=false time=600][resumevoice][large]Eh?[rf] [chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服08g(中) textoff=0][cacheimage storage=桜制服05f(中)][wvl canskip=false time=600]Ah, [chgfg time=200 storage=桜制服05f(中) textoff=0][cacheimage storage=桜制服14c(中)][wvl canskip=false time=500]um, [chgfg time=200 storage=桜制服14c(中) textoff=0][wvl canskip=false time=500]could you repeat the question, Himuro-senpai?"::
35746::$$$message_0264_0243_0000$$$::"I'm asking if Shinji Matou and Ayako Mitsuzuri, in other words, your older brother and your former captain, are dating."::
35747::$$$message_0264_0244_0000$$$::"How would that even happen!?"::
35748::$$$message_0264_0245_0000$$$::   She's right, now that she mentions it.::
35749::$$$message_0264_0246_0000$$$::Shinji Matou, dating Lady Mitsuzuri.[lr]::
35750::$$$message_0264_0246_0001$$$::The combination is just too implausible, if you think about it. I did know that all along.::
35751::$$$message_0264_0247_0000$$$::"Miss Matou? Um, erm..."::
35752::$$$message_0264_0248_0000$$$::"You see, [large]Miss Himuro[rf] here thought that you might know if the former Captain Mitsuzuri was dating your big brother."::
35753::$$$message_0264_0249_0000$$$::"That makes it sound like this was all my doing, [large]Miss Makidera[rf]."::
35754::$$$message_0264_0250_0000$$$::"I won't deny I suggested it, but you were the one who was curious about Lady Mitsuzuri's boyfriend, Makino-G."::
35755::$$$message_0264_0251_0000$$$::"Um, well, I'm not really sure, but..."::
35756::$$$message_0264_0252_0000$$$::Lady Matou looks flustered. Makidera and I started having a conversation about things she knows nothing about, so of course she'd be confused.::
35757::$$$message_0264_0253_0000$$$::"Judging from your reaction, you didn't expect that."::
35758::$$$message_0264_0254_0000$$$::"Yes. I don't think my brother could possibly be dating Mitsuzuri-senpai."::
35759::$$$message_0264_0255_0000$$$::"Ah, I thought so, Miss Matou. Thank goodness..."::
35760::$$$message_0264_0256_0000$$$::Yukika is relieved. She finally regains her gentle expression.::
35761::$$$message_0264_0257_0000$$$::"...We whiffed this one, Himuro. I'm taking away a cushion."::
35762::$$$message_0264_0258_0000$$$::"Take as many as you want. It's better to clearly rule out possibilities than act on vague ones."::
35763::$$$message_0264_0259_0000$$$::Makidera grumbles next to me, sounding more disappointed than I am.[lr]::
35764::$$$message_0264_0259_0001$$$::I'm not sure what standard she uses to award said cushions, but maybe her family runs on some kind of seat cushion-based hierarchy.[lr]::
35765::$$$message_0264_0259_0002$$$::I could see an old textile wholesaler still using such feudal customs.[lr]::
35766::$$$message_0264_0259_0003$$$::I stop myself from sighing in disappointment.[lr]::
35767::$$$message_0264_0259_0004$$$::Then, Lady Matou adds a remark.::
35768::$$$message_0264_0260_0000$$$::"My brother and Mitsuzuri-senpai have never gotten along. I don't know what she thinks of him...but at club, he's kind of..."::
35769::$$$message_0264_0261_0000$$$::"If it's something you're not comfortable saying to non-members, you don't have to."::
35770::$$$message_0264_0262_0000$$$::"We're just curious who Lady Mitsuzuri is in a relationship with."::
35771::$$$message_0264_0263_0000$$$::I remind Lady Matou, trying to ease her caution.[lr]::
35772::$$$message_0264_0263_0001$$$::At this rate, we're liable to step into the Matou siblings' family matters.::
35773::$$$message_0264_0264_0000$$$::Makidera addresses Lady Matou, her expression still clouded.::
35774::$$$message_0264_0265_0000$$$::"Well, Shinji's a different story. If you want to talk about it, we'll hear you out. He wouldn't be so annoying if he were a little more choosy with his partners."::
35775::$$$message_0264_0266_0000$$$::"He must be [font italic=true]really[font italic=false] problematic if he makes you say that, Maki."::
35776::$$$message_0264_0267_0000$$$::Makidera shushes me. Lady Matou smiles apologetically.::
35777::$$$message_0264_0268_0000$$$::I feel that we've done her a great disservice, but I should return her good humor.::
35778::$$$message_0264_0269_0000$$$::"Well, we're sorry for taking up your time, Miss Matou."::
35779::$$$message_0264_0270_0000$$$::"Oh, don't worry about it, Himuro-senpai."::
35780::$$$message_0264_0271_0000$$$::"One last question. Do you have any idea who Ayako Mitsuzuri is dating?"::
35781::$$$message_0264_0272_0000$$$::Lady Matou looks up thoughtfully.[lr]::
35782::$$$message_0264_0272_0001$$$::   Does she only have an idea? Does she know and not want to tell us?::
35783::$$$message_0264_0273_0000$$$::In the end, she nods.[lr]::
35784::$$$message_0264_0273_0001$$$::Though it's autumn in the forest, her smile blooms like a spring flower. [lr]::
35785::$$$message_0264_0273_0002$$$::"Ryudou-senpai would make a great match for Mitsuzuri-senpai."::
935658::$$$message_9264_0176_0000$$$::"...They're not very picturesque, this couple."[r]::

